cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the thesis as below."
type: software
title: "Linked Open Usable Data for Cultural Heritage: Website and HTML Version of the PhD Thesis"
abstract: >-
  Source of https://phd.julsraemy.ch, the companion website of the PhD thesis
  "Linked Open Usable Data for Cultural Heritage: Perspectives on Community
  Practices and Semantic Interoperability" (University of Basel, 2024). It
  provides an HTML version of the thesis with linked citations, acronyms and
  footnotes, full-text search, embedded IIIF viewers, and the related research
  outcomes.
